      "source_number": "110",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Oh, well, I mostly study philosophy and stuff. I mean, if we're going to bring about peace, then we need a good grounding for it, right?",
      "source_text": "Oh, well, I mostly study philosophy and stuff. I mean, if we're going to\n bring about peace, then we need a good grounding for it, right?",
